  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}没有克服困难的决心，\n就什么都无法跨越。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_200.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 05 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0D 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 83 09}好了……\n我给你们准备了\n正合适的特训！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_200.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C2 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}特、特训……！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_200.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 62 09}就叫阴影间歇对练！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_200.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}在这一层持续和阴影战斗，\n直到身体发出悲鸣……仅此而已。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_200.bf.json:9:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0D 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}正因为简单，\n对身体和精神都很严苛。\n但一定能收获良多……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_200.bf.json:9:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……怎么样？\n很喜欢吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_200.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}有意思{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_200.bf.json:10:1",
